@startuml
actor Usuário
participant "Frontend\n(React/Vite)" as Front
participant "Backend API\n(FastAPI)" as Back
participant "Scraper\n(Playwright)" as Scraper
participant "Motor IA\n(NLP)" as NLP
database "Supabase\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

Usuário -> Front : Solicita busca de vagas (RJ, Remoto)
Front -> Back : POST /api/search {filtros}
Back -> Scraper : Iniciar varredura
Scraper -> Back : Retorna HTML/Textos Brutos
Back -> Back : Valida Filtros Estritos (Descarta lixo)
Back -> NLP : Envia descrições válidas
NLP -> Back : Retorna Skills extraídas
Back -> DB : Salva histórico da busca
Back -> Front : Retorna JSON consolidado
Front -> Usuário : Exibe Dashboard Analítico
@enduml
